There are some studies about the effects of artificial diets on BSF development and adult life-history traits (Diener et al., 2009; Gobbi et al., 2013; Tomberlin et al., 2002), and others related to the effects of different types of organic waste or industrial by-products on BSF life-history traits (Diener et al., 2009; Lardé, 1989, 1990; Li et al., 2011a,c;
